Hello, I'm Myu the Confectioner!

I had set up my kitchen to start making my delicious cakes for the Children's Party. But when I woke up, my kitchen was a mess.
They took all my ingredients. There is no wheat left, not a spoonful of whipped cream or of my tasty cherries. It is chaos.

The Mischievous Minigue, the Party Yampi and the Party Hopi are looking for the ingredients. Can you help us?

[Challenge Objective]

Collect 2x Cherries, 2x Whipped Cream and 2x Wheat and deliver them to Myu the Confectioner.
